  "Overview": "Cold War Commander is a side-scrolling platformer in which the player assumes the role of Ronald Reagan, navigating a series of levels themed around the fight against communism. The primary objective in each stage is to collect all jellybeans before reaching the exit. Gameplay emphasizes evasion, as Reagan lacks any means of defense against environmental hazards such as lava or against patrolling communist enemies. Progress depends on precise jumping and careful timing to avoid these threats.\n\nAdditionally, Cold War Commander has two non-game functions: Controller Massage and Controller Race which both utilize the rumble function of the Xbox 360 controller.",
